        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We manage our technology investment to discover and develop new active ingredients and biological products, as well as to continue to improve manufacturing processes and existing active ingredients through new formulations, mixtures or other concepts.",
